  "description": "Dalsez Westwood is a young, talented magician without a care in the world, until one day his eyes suddenly begin to turn amber, prompting a series of events which will lead him to discover the truth of the world in which he lives and the mysterious Abyss which surrounds it. This is the story of a boy filled with light. \n\n*Note: Includes two prologues, a special chapter, and an epilogue.*",
